{"id":"660785","name":"西红柿炒鸡蛋","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660785/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西红柿洗净开水烫30秒。","img":"images/660785/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮。","img":"images/660785/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西红柿切块，鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/660785/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"先炒鸡蛋，然后盛出。","img":"images/660785/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"油热下葱花炸香。","img":"images/660785/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入西红柿翻炒。","img":"images/660785/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加盐，花椒粉，味素炒出西红柿变软。","img":"images/660785/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入鸡蛋炒匀。","img":"images/660785/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660785/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}